cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this dataset, please cite it as below."
type: dataset
title: "Mobile Data Price Index — metered eSIM rates for 193 countries"
authors:
  - name: "Roamzy"
    website: "https://roamzy.io"
repository-code: "https://github.com/roamzy-io/mobile-data-price-index"
url: "https://roamzy.io/prices"
license: CC-BY-4.0
keywords:
  - mobile data
  - eSIM
  - roaming
  - prices
  - telecom
  - open data
abstract: >-
  Retail price of metered mobile data by country, in USD per megabyte and per
  gigabyte, taken from the live Roamzy eSIM price list. One provider, one
  currency, one unit for all 193 countries; refreshed daily with every change
  snapshotted, so any figure can be cited by version or date.
